  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_4670.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El d&iacute;a del Salvador, patr&oacute;n de Onda, ha finalizado con el canto de los gozos, de los que el a&ntilde;o pasado se recuper&oacute; su harmonizaci&oacute;n musical, a cargo del coro de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia, en&nbsp;un todav&iacute;a animado&nbsp;ermitorio,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_4697.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>y la procesi&oacute;n en&nbsp;el barrio que lleva su nombre, por todo el centro hist&oacute;rico.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelsalvadorgojosambientprocessobarri/img_4655.jpg\" alt=\"img_4655\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelsalvadorgojosambientprocessobarri/img_4656.jpg\" alt=\"img_4656\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelsalvadorgojosambientprocessobarri/img_4657.jpg\" alt=\"img_4657\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelsalvadorgojosambientprocessobarri/img_4658.jpg\" alt=\"img_4658\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelsalvadorgojosambientprocessobarri/img_4659.jpg\" alt=\"img_4659\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelsalvadorgojosambientprocessobarri/img_4660.jpg\" alt=\"img_4660\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelsalvadorgojosambientprocessobarri/img_4661.jpg\" alt=\"img_4661\" style=\"max-width:100%;hei